{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 DrumKey\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Play your MIDI keyboard + Sustain pedal like it was an e-drum set.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Sustain Pedal down triggers fixed velocity notes\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mod wheel or chosen CC controls Hi-hat open-ness.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Duplicate input keys for Snare and Toms for easier fills\sa180\par}
}

